# CR 702.11b/e: Hexproof's Activator$ Opponent gate (cardCantBeTargetedBy,
# staticability.go) only ever refuses an opponent's spell or ability --
# human's own Lightning Bolt at human's own hexproof Rubbleback Rhino stays
# a legal target throughout, so Bolt resolves normally.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
queue targets 1
queue action human cast 3
passpriority
